This is guitar chord lesson of Mera Mann Kehne Laga sung by Falak Shabir along with the strumming pattern  from the upcoming new Bollywood movie Nautanki Saala . It is the story of bonding and friendship between Ram Parmar (Ayushmann Khuranna) who one night meets Mandar Lele (Kunaal Kapur) who is troubled and lonely.

